OL,6,
OL,7,FThe first polls have closed in the US
OL,8,Fmidterm elections, which will decide
OL,9,Fwho controls Congress for the rest of
OL,10,FDonald Trump's presidency - when will
OL,11,Fwe get results?
OL,13,FA majority of voters are unhappy with
OL,14,Fthe economy, a major survey suggests -
OL,15,Fread the latest from our data team
OL,17,FWhat's up for grabs? All 435 seats in
OL,18,Fthe House; 35 of the 100 seats in the
OL,19,FSenate; and some state-level
OL,20,Fpoliticians, including governors - here
OL,21,Fare the key races
